eady attacked rather than waiting for its first external test. That practice also works on its own, for clients who never buy a line of code from us. We work with regulated organisations across finance, healthcare, logistics and public sector, and we publish our own security posture at /trust.\",\"slogan\":\"We build the software. Then we try to break it.\",\"email\":\"hello@envenox.com\",\"telephone\":\"+44 20 4525 9101\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/envenox\",\"https://github.com/envenox\",\"https://x.com/envenox\"],\"address\":[{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT\",\"addressLocality\":\"London\",\"addressCountry\":\"United Kingdom\"},{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Level 7, Bay’s Galleria, Gulshan 1, Dhaka 1212\",\"addressLocality\":\"Dhaka\",\"addressCountry\":\"Bangladesh\"}],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"emergency\",\"name\":\"Incident response hotline\",\"telephone\":\"+44 20 4525 9100\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"en\"],\"hoursAvailable\":{\"@type\":\"OpeningHoursSpecification\",\"dayOfWeek\":[\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\",\"Sunday\"],\"opens\":\"00:00\",\"closes\":\"23:59\"}},{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"sales\",\"email\":\"hello@envenox.com\",\"telephone\":\"+44 20 4525 9101\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"en\"]},{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"security\",\"email\":\"security@envenox.com\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"en\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#website\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com\",\"name\":\"Envenox\",\"description\":\"Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://enve